  "details": "Persistent Sticker AMD Items System\n\nVRChat needs more ways to celebrate birthdays individually in any world. I propose a set of buyable Marketplace items to turn any location into a party spot:\n\n​Interactive Props: String lights with attached balloons, fireworks/rockets, sparklers, and a wearable \"Happy Birthday\" crown.\n\n​Persistent Stickers: A system where users can place stickers or custom messages on walls. These should stay in place for the duration of the session (\"Session Persistence\") until the instance ends or a moderator clears them.\n\nThese items would allow users to personalize their favorite spots for friends, making birthdays a truly unique experience anywhere in the VRChat universe.",
